## PM Quality Check

* [ ] Risks describe future uncertainty.
* [ ] Causes and impacts are identified.
* [ ] Likelihood and impact are assessed.
* [ ] High and critical risks have owners.
* [ ] Response strategies are defined.
* [ ] Controls are documented where appropriate.
* [ ] Triggers are identified.
* [ ] Risks are reviewed regularly.
* [ ] Residual risk is understood.

